---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { hasAmazonTag } from '../lib/affiliate';
---
<Base title="About">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>About ModY</h1>
    <p>ModY is a small, independent directory of Tesla accessories and mods, starting with the Model Y. It exists because finding the right accessory usually means wading through look-alike listings, padded "top 10" lists, and unclear fitment.</p>
    <h2>Our rules</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Real products only.</strong> Every listing links to the manufacturer or a major retailer.</li>
      <li><strong>No invented prices or scores.</strong> Prices change constantly, so we send you to the retailer for the current price.</li>
      <li><strong>Fitment first.</strong> We note which model years and configurations each item is listed for.</li>
      <li><strong>Plain notes.</strong> Who it's for, and the trade-offs.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>How ModY will pay for itself</h2>
    {hasAmazonTag
      ? <p>ModY uses affiliate links on some Amazon listings. Those links are labeled “Affiliate”. As an Amazon Associate, ModY earns from qualifying purchases, at no extra cost to you. Down the road we may also add clearly labeled featured listings or sponsors. Paid placement will always be marked, and it will never change the notes or the fitment info.</p>
      : <p>ModY may use affiliate links, clearly labeled featured listings, or sponsors. Any affiliate link is labeled “Affiliate” when present. Paid placement will always be marked, and it will never change the notes or the fitment info.</p>}
    <p>ModY is not affiliated with Tesla, Inc.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
